# UBSAN suppressions (tools/build.sh passes this file in UBSAN_OPTIONS; docs/testing.md, "Sanitizers").
# Only third-party code may be listed: Mesa (llvmpipe, lavapipe), X11, fontconfig and the vendored
# libraries under libs/ and engine/libs/. Engine and editor code is never suppressed: fix it.
# Every entry has a comment line above it giving the reason.

# vendored miniz (basisu's copy, under the tinyexr that writeExr uses): built with
# MINIZ_USE_UNALIGNED_LOADS_AND_STORES, its match finder reads 16-bit words at odd addresses on
# purpose (x86 permits it); reached by upstream's FloatImage EXR writes (FloatImageTest)
alignment:basisu_miniz.h
